WEBVTT

00:09.884 --> 00:11.886
[theme music]

00:13.138 --> 00:15.056
[squelching]

00:23.523 --> 00:29.946
[all snarling]

00:30.029 --> 00:31.406
Hey. Start recording.

00:31.489 --> 00:33.241
[laughs]
I'll defeat you,

00:33.324 --> 00:35.785
and rule as most powerful! Hah!

00:35.869 --> 00:37.662
-[all laugh]
-Not a chance.

00:37.746 --> 00:39.539
[grunting]

00:39.622 --> 00:42.417
-Asshole! It hurts like hell! Shit!
-[all laughing]

00:42.500 --> 00:46.671
Don't come near me! Aah! Stop! That hurts!

00:46.755 --> 00:48.339
[students screaming]

00:48.423 --> 00:50.175
-What the hell?
-[both screaming]

00:50.258 --> 00:52.260
-[grunting]
-Run!

00:52.343 --> 00:53.720
[growling]

00:54.512 --> 00:55.555
Shit!

00:57.140 --> 00:59.893
-Shit. Shit. Shit. Fuck.
-[snarling]

00:59.976 --> 01:01.728
Aah, you must be mistaken.

01:01.811 --> 01:04.022
Our students are required
to check in their phones.

01:04.105 --> 01:05.523
None of them could've called you.

01:06.524 --> 01:07.442
Yeah.

01:08.276 --> 01:10.278
Yes, of course. Everything is just great.

01:10.361 --> 01:11.613
Have a nice day.

01:12.906 --> 01:14.032
-[grunts]
-[phone thuds]

01:15.283 --> 01:18.036
Didn't I tell you to make sure
to take away their phones?

01:18.119 --> 01:20.580
I even got you safes,
and they're saying zombies!

01:20.663 --> 01:22.165
What the hell is wrong with you all?

01:22.248 --> 01:23.875
You can't deny
there's a problem out there.

01:23.958 --> 01:24.834
It's complete madness.

01:24.918 --> 01:26.961
We need the police and rescuers
to get the kids out--

01:27.045 --> 01:29.088
Are you the only teacher?
Are you that special?

01:29.172 --> 01:31.591
Whatever happens inside this school
must be handled internally!

01:31.674 --> 01:33.760
Go! Put the kids in their classrooms.

01:33.843 --> 01:35.470
But, sir, I don't think the students

01:35.553 --> 01:37.806
are in the situation
where they will listen to us at all.

01:37.889 --> 01:39.599
What are you still doing here?
Get out there!

01:39.682 --> 01:42.185
And if you'd go out right now,
you can see for yourself

01:42.268 --> 01:44.020
-that it's total chaos.
-Just do as you're told.

01:44.103 --> 01:46.564
I made you the dean
to discipline them, so do that!

01:47.065 --> 01:50.109
Where are you going, Sun-hwa?
Don't do anything stupid. Stay here!

01:50.193 --> 01:52.654
I'm going to make an announcement
to tell all the kids to leave.

01:52.737 --> 01:54.739
[students clamoring]

01:54.823 --> 01:57.075
PRINCIPAL'S OFFICE

01:57.158 --> 01:59.160
[ominous music]

02:01.412 --> 02:03.540
[thudding]

02:05.917 --> 02:07.293
[teacher 1] Hey, kid.

02:07.377 --> 02:09.504
-What's up with your leg?
-[growling]

02:09.587 --> 02:10.839
Hey, stop that!

02:10.922 --> 02:11.798
-[squelches]
-[screams]

02:11.881 --> 02:13.049
Hey! What are you doing?

02:14.717 --> 02:15.677
Cut that out!

02:15.760 --> 02:17.846
[snarling]

02:18.429 --> 02:19.430
Ah…

02:21.558 --> 02:23.852
[whimpering]

02:23.935 --> 02:27.730
[panting]

02:27.814 --> 02:30.650
[tense music]

02:30.733 --> 02:32.610
[growling]

02:35.488 --> 02:36.531
What's with you?

02:37.073 --> 02:38.658
Help! Help!

02:38.741 --> 02:39.993
[clanks]

02:41.494 --> 02:44.330
[fire alarm beeping]

02:46.082 --> 02:47.375
[growls]

02:48.668 --> 02:49.919
[screams]

02:56.426 --> 02:58.803
[grunting]

03:02.473 --> 03:03.808
[On-jo screams]

03:03.892 --> 03:06.311
[all clamoring]

03:07.437 --> 03:09.063
On-jo. Are you good?

03:10.231 --> 03:11.232
Hey!

03:11.316 --> 03:14.819
[water trickling]

03:14.903 --> 03:15.904
Get up.

03:15.987 --> 03:18.031
[tense music continues]

03:19.407 --> 03:20.950
-[student yells]
-[groans]

03:22.619 --> 03:24.662
[choking]

03:24.746 --> 03:25.788
Are you okay?

03:25.872 --> 03:28.750
[bones crunching]

03:28.833 --> 03:30.835
[snarling]

03:30.919 --> 03:33.129
[whimpering]

03:34.130 --> 03:36.799
[grunting]

03:38.635 --> 03:41.054
Go! Haste! Let's undo this.

03:41.137 --> 03:43.139
-[growling]
-[wailing]

03:46.476 --> 03:48.853
[tense music]

03:52.315 --> 03:53.816
[student 1] Hurry and get up there!

03:54.651 --> 03:55.652
Let's go over there!

03:56.361 --> 03:57.278
Come on.

03:59.280 --> 04:02.116
[all clamoring]

04:05.370 --> 04:08.373
[blood splattering]

04:08.456 --> 04:10.291
[screeches]

04:11.459 --> 04:13.461
[foreboding music]

04:22.387 --> 04:23.471
[gasps]

04:26.307 --> 04:28.810
[whimpering]

04:33.481 --> 04:34.607
[tray clanks]

04:34.691 --> 04:36.359
[panting]

04:39.028 --> 04:40.029
Fuck!

04:40.113 --> 04:42.699
[grunting]

04:42.782 --> 04:44.200
Fuck!

04:49.205 --> 04:50.290
[tray clanks]

04:50.373 --> 04:51.416
[gasps]

04:54.002 --> 04:55.086
[snarls]

04:57.672 --> 04:58.631
Come on.

04:58.715 --> 04:59.716
You go first.

04:59.799 --> 05:01.884
[foreboding music continues]

05:02.927 --> 05:04.220
[snarls]

05:04.304 --> 05:06.264
[grunting]

05:11.894 --> 05:13.062
[indistinct chatter]

05:15.106 --> 05:16.691
[yells]

05:21.863 --> 05:26.075
[panting]

05:26.159 --> 05:28.661
[muffled growling]

05:28.745 --> 05:33.583
[breathing heavily]

05:40.923 --> 05:41.924
Oh, shit!

05:47.263 --> 05:49.265
[suspenseful music]

05:52.226 --> 05:53.311
[gasps]

05:53.394 --> 05:55.563
Get out. No!

05:56.147 --> 05:58.149
[ominous music]

05:58.232 --> 05:59.650
[growling]

05:59.734 --> 06:01.194
[gasps]
Cheong-san!

06:01.277 --> 06:03.362
[snarling]

06:04.781 --> 06:07.075
[growling]

06:09.035 --> 06:10.411
Why aren't you coming? Come on!

06:12.622 --> 06:13.498
[Cheong-san] On-jo.

06:14.248 --> 06:15.958
Hurry up!
[pants]

06:19.754 --> 06:21.506
-[growls]
-[screams]

06:21.589 --> 06:23.508
[snarling]

06:24.550 --> 06:25.760
[growling]

06:25.843 --> 06:28.471
[ominous music continues]

06:32.058 --> 06:33.810
[students screaming]

06:33.893 --> 06:34.811
Run!

06:34.894 --> 06:37.105
-[breathing heavily]
-[screaming]

06:39.690 --> 06:42.401
[snarling]

06:43.861 --> 06:45.822
[tires screeching]

06:45.905 --> 06:47.490
HYOSAN BUILDING MATERIALS

06:55.790 --> 06:57.583
[crashes]

07:00.670 --> 07:02.672
[suspenseful music]

07:10.680 --> 07:13.141
[breathing heavily]

07:15.309 --> 07:17.437
[snarling]

07:19.397 --> 07:21.732
[both panting]

07:22.525 --> 07:24.902
[grunting]

07:34.829 --> 07:36.789
[both panting]

07:38.166 --> 07:41.627
-[students clamoring]
-[both grunt]

07:43.921 --> 07:46.424
[growling]

07:46.507 --> 07:48.801
[both panting]

07:51.262 --> 07:52.847
[lady screaming]

07:55.016 --> 07:56.225
[whimpers]

07:56.309 --> 07:58.311
[tense music]

08:02.315 --> 08:04.817
[Cheong-san grunting]

08:07.820 --> 08:12.325
[hissing]

08:14.327 --> 08:15.828
[coughing]

08:18.414 --> 08:20.708
[suspenseful music]

08:24.462 --> 08:26.380
Come. This way. This way.

08:27.965 --> 08:29.175
-[slams]
-[gasps]

08:31.636 --> 08:32.970
[student 2] Wait up for me!

08:34.764 --> 08:37.350
Stay away. Stay away, son of a bitch.

08:37.433 --> 08:38.434
[grunts]

08:39.060 --> 08:41.771
-[clanking]
-[whimpering]

08:43.481 --> 08:44.482
[grunts]

08:44.565 --> 08:46.734
You should've stayed away, fucker!

08:47.652 --> 08:49.820
[shouting]

08:51.572 --> 08:53.491
[distant screaming]

08:54.992 --> 08:57.828
-[Gyeong-su] Shit. What's going on?
-[banging on door]

08:58.829 --> 09:00.790
-[thudding]
-Don't open the door. Don't open it!

09:00.873 --> 09:02.124
Let go.

09:02.208 --> 09:04.794
Hurry up! Lock the door! Go!

09:04.877 --> 09:06.003
I need to open it.

09:06.087 --> 09:07.421
You open it!

09:07.505 --> 09:08.548
[Gyeong-su] Move!

09:08.631 --> 09:10.299
[On-jo pants]

09:11.217 --> 09:12.677
-[door slams]
-[scream]

09:12.760 --> 09:13.719
Are you okay?

09:14.220 --> 09:15.096
On-jo!

09:18.015 --> 09:18.975
Are you okay?

09:20.309 --> 09:22.186
How's the campus? Are we dead or what?

09:22.979 --> 09:25.398
[panting]

09:27.358 --> 09:30.570
[distant clamoring]

09:33.072 --> 09:34.115
Hey.

09:34.198 --> 09:36.576
-What the hell? Who are you?
-Asshole. Brother…

09:36.659 --> 09:38.244
-Brother-in-law.
-Oh, come in.

09:40.538 --> 09:41.872
Holy shit.

09:42.540 --> 09:43.833
They're so aggressive.

09:44.500 --> 09:45.793
What happened to your face, huh?

09:45.876 --> 09:48.713
I don't know, some crazy jerk sprayed me
with a fire extinguisher.

09:48.796 --> 09:51.048
-[Gyeong-su] A fire extinguisher?
-Yeah, damn it.

09:51.132 --> 09:52.300
[pants]

09:52.383 --> 09:53.551
What's happening?

09:53.634 --> 09:54.635
Who knows?

09:54.719 --> 09:55.845
Train.

09:57.221 --> 09:58.973
-Train to Busan.
-The movie?

09:59.849 --> 10:01.684
Aren't they zombies? It's the same thing.

10:01.767 --> 10:04.228
Zombies are at school?
You watch too much TV.

10:05.313 --> 10:06.939
Watch this. It's true.

10:07.023 --> 10:08.566
[breathing heavily]

10:10.651 --> 10:12.028
-[sighs]
-Really?

10:12.111 --> 10:13.821
[Joon-hyeong] The door! Door!

10:13.904 --> 10:14.780
Right.

10:14.864 --> 10:15.948
[grunts]

10:17.074 --> 10:19.160
[gasps]
Shit. What the hell?

10:19.243 --> 10:20.870
-[slams]
-What the fuck is that?

10:20.953 --> 10:23.414
-Bare-su! It's Bare-su! Help him up!
-Quick! Quick! Quick!

10:23.497 --> 10:24.999
Get in here. Hurry, man. You okay?

10:25.082 --> 10:27.168
-Nam-ra! Hurry!
-[Wu-jin] Come on!

10:27.251 --> 10:29.712
-Hurry! Come on! Jump!
-[snarling]

10:32.089 --> 10:33.090
Close it. Quick.

10:33.174 --> 10:34.508
Are you okay?

10:34.592 --> 10:36.010
[both pant]

10:36.761 --> 10:39.722
[panting]

10:41.307 --> 10:42.475
It's that, isn't it?

10:43.726 --> 10:44.602
Zombies.

10:44.685 --> 10:46.771
[panting]

10:52.985 --> 10:57.281
[growling]

10:57.365 --> 11:00.910
EMERGENCY MEDICAL CENTER

11:00.993 --> 11:02.286
AMBULANCE

11:05.331 --> 11:06.582
[So-ju] One, two, three.

11:09.126 --> 11:11.545
-[doctor] What happened to her?
-She came from the school.

11:11.629 --> 11:14.840
She was bleeding when we got there.
But we're not sure exactly what caused it.

11:14.924 --> 11:17.551
-When was she injured?
-We got the call about 30 minutes ago.

11:17.635 --> 11:19.136
[doctor] Why is she lethargic?

11:19.220 --> 11:21.138
[So-ju] She seemed to be
having seizures at first,

11:21.222 --> 11:22.473
but she calmed down now.

11:26.227 --> 11:27.478
[beeps]

11:28.687 --> 11:31.315
[handcuffs clinking]

11:36.654 --> 11:39.657
[Jae-ik] You received the PhD
in cell biology in the US,

11:39.740 --> 11:40.783
returned to Korea.

11:40.866 --> 11:44.620
You were a pharmaceutical researcher
and quit, then teaching.

11:46.247 --> 11:48.666
You should be a college professor
with this résumé.

11:48.749 --> 11:50.876
Definitely not
some lousy high school teacher.

11:51.502 --> 11:54.755
The hospital needs to put Hyeon-ju
to quarantine, nothing less.

11:55.423 --> 11:59.552
Why would a teacher decide
to chain a student?

11:59.635 --> 12:01.595
If I were a college professor…

12:02.430 --> 12:05.182
If I were a prosecutor, or a reporter,
would you have listened?

12:05.266 --> 12:08.018
Ah, that's why you did it.

12:08.727 --> 12:11.939
Because no one listened to you
or understood how you felt?

12:12.022 --> 12:14.525
You were lonely, maybe saddened.
Is that it?

12:15.317 --> 12:16.152
Fine.

12:17.695 --> 12:18.737
Let's do nothing.

12:20.406 --> 12:21.282
Everyone will die.

12:22.241 --> 12:24.660
This world and all those damned imbeciles.

12:25.578 --> 12:27.872
[suspenseful music]

12:31.083 --> 12:31.917
[grunts]

12:32.877 --> 12:36.922
I hate you assholes. You're a sick kind.
Can't stand you.

12:38.299 --> 12:42.094
You commit the crime,
but you blame others, society, everything.

12:42.887 --> 12:47.641
When you reported your son missing,
you said, "The world swallowed my son."

12:47.725 --> 12:50.394
What the hell's that supposed to mean?
What, is the world an anaconda?

12:50.478 --> 12:51.562
[Jae-ik scoffs]

12:52.313 --> 12:53.772
It didn't swallow him.

12:55.691 --> 12:57.234
Tell me what really happened to him.

12:58.819 --> 12:59.737
You killed your son.

13:00.571 --> 13:04.325
But you reported him missing
to avoid being a suspect. Am I right?

13:05.409 --> 13:07.495
Your son isn't missing, is he?

13:09.330 --> 13:10.581
What happened to him, huh?

13:10.664 --> 13:12.833
[suspenseful music continues]

13:15.544 --> 13:17.046
Jin-su is dead.

13:21.008 --> 13:22.927
[breathes heavily]

13:24.386 --> 13:25.888
I placed the mouse and cat together.

13:26.555 --> 13:27.765
MINSONG GYMNASIUM

13:27.848 --> 13:29.934
[Byeong-chan]
Most of the mice sat in a corner,

13:30.017 --> 13:32.478
and were frozen, trembling in fear.

13:35.481 --> 13:36.524
But once in a while,

13:36.607 --> 13:39.401
the mouse would lose its senses
due to the overwhelming fear

13:39.485 --> 13:40.861
and attack the cat.

13:41.946 --> 13:45.282
When this happens,
its testosterone level shoots up.

13:45.908 --> 13:48.661
I extracted that hormone and refined it.

13:48.744 --> 13:51.580
For all the mice in this world
living in fear, trembling.

13:51.664 --> 13:53.874
[ominous music]

14:00.548 --> 14:01.465
[squishes]

14:04.343 --> 14:05.427
[burbling]

14:05.511 --> 14:07.429
[Byeong-chan]
I thought if fear turned into rage,

14:07.513 --> 14:09.098
he'd become stronger than anyone.

14:10.266 --> 14:12.685
[growling]

14:14.436 --> 14:15.646
[Byeong-chan] He bit his mom.

14:15.729 --> 14:19.066
[growling]

14:19.149 --> 14:21.235
Infection, day 17.

14:21.318 --> 14:24.655
I gave him benzodiazepine
and stopped the haloperidol.

14:25.364 --> 14:27.199
He'll be awake in less than ten minutes.

14:27.283 --> 14:29.827
[loud banging on door]

14:33.122 --> 14:34.540
[thuds]

14:35.040 --> 14:36.417
You killed your son, didn't you?

14:38.544 --> 14:44.049
[breathing sharply]

14:45.092 --> 14:47.469
[keyboard clacking]

14:49.638 --> 14:51.181
[whirring]

14:54.727 --> 14:55.769
[chimes]

14:57.521 --> 14:58.689
-What the…
-Get her! Get her!

14:58.772 --> 14:59.648
Turn it off!

15:01.525 --> 15:03.944
[growling]

15:05.821 --> 15:07.156
[grunting]

15:10.743 --> 15:11.827
Hold her down!

15:14.663 --> 15:20.294
-[tense music]
-[bones crunching]

15:20.878 --> 15:21.837
Oh…

15:22.379 --> 15:24.381
[growling]

15:24.465 --> 15:25.549
[nurse whimpers]

15:25.633 --> 15:27.468
[snarling]

15:29.470 --> 15:31.180
[nurse screams]

15:31.263 --> 15:32.473
[objects clattering]

15:32.556 --> 15:34.975
-What's that sound?
-What's going on?

15:35.059 --> 15:36.310
[device blares]

15:36.393 --> 15:38.562
[objects clanging]

15:38.646 --> 15:40.397
[old woman]
Is something going on in there?

15:40.981 --> 15:42.608
[nurse wailing]

15:42.691 --> 15:44.401
Please help me.

15:45.110 --> 15:47.029
-Call the police! Please hurry!
-[growls]

15:47.112 --> 15:48.405
[screams]

15:48.489 --> 15:49.782
[squelching]

15:49.865 --> 15:51.533
[screams]

15:52.242 --> 15:56.580
[growling]

15:56.664 --> 15:58.707
[tense music]

16:00.167 --> 16:04.713
-[music stops]
-[panting]

16:08.008 --> 16:12.346
[quivering]

16:18.477 --> 16:20.437
[horn honking]

16:20.521 --> 16:21.605
[tires screeching]

16:21.689 --> 16:23.273
God, I almost run her over.

16:23.357 --> 16:24.441
What's the girl's problem?

16:26.652 --> 16:28.570
[engine revs]

16:32.324 --> 16:35.536
People, you know what happens
when you perform like that?

16:37.329 --> 16:39.123
[sighs]
Jang Ha-ri, get up.

16:40.457 --> 16:41.291
Okay.

16:44.211 --> 16:45.587
[coach] Take a good look.

16:45.671 --> 16:47.047
She's your future.

16:49.299 --> 16:50.718
Ha-ri's a senior…

16:52.136 --> 16:54.304
without a single gold medal.

16:54.388 --> 16:57.891
Forget the nationals
if she can't even make the reserves.

16:57.975 --> 17:00.352
Couldn't even pass
today's regional qualifier.

17:00.978 --> 17:02.938
What will you do, hm?

17:03.981 --> 17:07.818
She can't get into college,
a corporate team…

17:07.901 --> 17:10.446
No civil service exam. You didn't study.

17:11.530 --> 17:14.992
Listen here. Do you know
how cruel this field is?

17:15.701 --> 17:18.954
The CSAT top 100 kids get
into Seoul, yeah.

17:20.372 --> 17:22.291
But if you're top 100 in archery,

17:23.125 --> 17:25.377
you can't get anywhere near the Olympics.

17:25.461 --> 17:27.463
You're the tritest rot.

17:27.546 --> 17:29.214
Wasting away. Got it?

17:30.132 --> 17:30.966
HYOSAN HIGH SCHOOL

17:31.050 --> 17:32.718
-[tires screech]
-[groans]

17:34.178 --> 17:36.096
-[glass cracks]
-[growling]

17:36.180 --> 17:37.514
Shit. Fucking nut…

17:37.598 --> 17:40.017
-[snarling]
-[suspenseful music]

17:43.020 --> 17:44.563
[driver] What the…

17:44.646 --> 17:46.774
[suspenseful music continues]

17:48.984 --> 17:51.487
-[Wu-jin] See if it's there.
-[Joon-hyeong] It's not here, either.

17:51.570 --> 17:54.531
Hey, Joon-yeong! I think you're right.
They can't open doors.

17:54.615 --> 17:56.784
Uh… Let's hold it shut for now.

17:56.867 --> 17:59.036
-Did you find one?
-There's nothing here, either.

17:59.119 --> 18:00.204
-Damn it.
-Any luck, Dae-su?

18:00.287 --> 18:01.413
Are you okay?

18:02.206 --> 18:03.290
Look over there.

18:05.793 --> 18:08.128
-It's not here, either.
-[I-sak] Here!

18:09.254 --> 18:10.297
I found one!

18:13.509 --> 18:14.510
Whose is it?

18:15.135 --> 18:16.512
This is Yeong-ju's desk.

18:16.595 --> 18:17.971
Shit. It's locked.

18:19.515 --> 18:20.557
Do something.

18:20.641 --> 18:22.267
What do you want me to do? It's locked.

18:22.893 --> 18:24.478
[Hyo-ryeong] Maybe it's her birthday.

18:25.104 --> 18:26.355
-When is that?
-[desk clatters]

18:26.438 --> 18:28.440
-I don't know. Hmm…
-[I-sak sighs]

18:31.735 --> 18:33.237
She's over there. Give it.

18:33.320 --> 18:36.698
[suspenseful music]

18:40.327 --> 18:42.287
SWIPE UP FOR FACE ID OR ENTER PASSCODE

18:42.371 --> 18:44.331
[snarls]

18:46.834 --> 18:48.293
You're gonna have to get closer.

18:50.379 --> 18:52.548
[snarling]

18:54.091 --> 18:55.968
For emergency calls,
you don't have to do that.

18:56.051 --> 18:57.386
Just call 112.

19:00.556 --> 19:02.558
AT THE SCENE AS QUICKLY AS POSSIBLE

19:02.641 --> 19:06.019
[phone ringing]

19:06.103 --> 19:08.522
-Hello. What is your emergency?
-[Cheong-san] Hello?

19:08.605 --> 19:10.023
This is Hyosan High School.

19:10.107 --> 19:13.110
A ton of zombies showed up at lunch,
and they're eating people.

19:13.193 --> 19:14.611
[whispers]
Don't say zombies.

19:15.195 --> 19:16.155
[Cheong-san] Then what?

19:16.238 --> 19:17.781
[On-jo] They won't believe you.

19:17.865 --> 19:20.325
Did you happen to see
the movie Train to Busan?

19:20.409 --> 19:22.452
[dispatcher 1] Okay. Hyosan High, zombies.

19:22.536 --> 19:25.038
Please give me your name and phone number.

19:25.122 --> 19:27.749
You know you'll get in trouble
for making these false reports, right?

19:27.833 --> 19:29.418
This isn't a joke.

19:30.252 --> 19:31.253
Everyone's…

19:32.713 --> 19:33.881
Anyway, come quick.

19:33.964 --> 19:34.882
Okay.

19:35.716 --> 19:37.718
-Lee Cheong-san.
-[keyboard clacking]

19:37.801 --> 19:41.430
Your number is 010-4362…

19:41.513 --> 19:44.224
Get somewhere safe,
so that you don't get bitten. Okay?

19:44.308 --> 19:46.059
We'll be there soon to check. Okay?

19:47.311 --> 19:49.855
[sighs]
These brats think they're so damn clever.

19:51.356 --> 19:52.774
Zombies are attacking.

19:52.858 --> 19:54.109
Hyosan High, right?

19:54.943 --> 19:56.945
They must be celebrating or something.

19:57.029 --> 19:58.697
I just got a call about zombies too, sir.

19:58.780 --> 20:00.449
Hello. What is the nature
of your emergency?

20:00.532 --> 20:03.160
You're cutting out.
A patient is attacking people?

20:04.036 --> 20:05.913
Does the person have some type of weapon?

20:07.164 --> 20:08.457
She's biting them?

20:09.416 --> 20:10.918
Zombie girl?

20:11.585 --> 20:13.670
-Hey. Go and call the school and verify.
-[phone rings]

20:13.754 --> 20:15.756
-Okay.
-[phones ringing]

20:15.839 --> 20:17.090
Hello. What's your emergency?

20:17.174 --> 20:18.842
Hello. What is the nature
of your emergency?

20:18.926 --> 20:20.677
-A person is biting people?
-What did you say?

20:20.761 --> 20:23.847
-[phones ringing]
-[overlapping chatter]

20:23.931 --> 20:25.933
SCHOOL MOTTO
HAPPY STUDENTS, SAFE SCHOOL

20:26.016 --> 20:28.352
CLASS MOTTO
SUN-HWA IS WATCHING

20:29.519 --> 20:30.729
-[growls]
-[student 3] No!

20:30.812 --> 20:32.814
[zombies growling]

20:32.898 --> 20:34.608
Whoa, what's going on?

20:34.691 --> 20:36.777
-Where are they going?
-Why are they leaving?

20:40.364 --> 20:43.283
-What are you doing, moron? Close it.
-Okay, fine.

20:43.367 --> 20:44.493
You scared me.

20:44.576 --> 20:45.786
And the police?

20:46.745 --> 20:48.080
He said they'll come.

20:48.956 --> 20:49.790
Did they believe you?

20:50.540 --> 20:52.834
What if they think it's a prank
and decide not to come?

20:52.918 --> 20:54.962
Well, then try again!

20:55.045 --> 20:57.256
-And tell them to hurry up!
-Shh. Stop yelling.

20:57.339 --> 20:58.632
What if those zombies come back?

20:59.633 --> 21:00.509
Give me that.

21:01.510 --> 21:03.011
[beeping]

21:04.763 --> 21:07.641
-[distant screaming]
-[line rings]

21:08.600 --> 21:11.186
[dispatcher 2] Fire Department.
What's the nature of your emergency?

21:11.270 --> 21:12.521
Hi. Hello, sir.

21:12.604 --> 21:15.107
Do you know Captain Nam So-ju
from Rescue Team One?

21:15.190 --> 21:17.609
I'm afraid I don't.
We have many firefighters.

21:17.693 --> 21:18.610
What is this about?

21:19.236 --> 21:21.822
Captain Nam So-ju is my father.

21:21.905 --> 21:24.241
Please tell him
to hurry over to my school.

21:24.324 --> 21:26.326
-Who is she calling?
-Sorry. This is the call center.

21:26.410 --> 21:28.870
You should call his station
if you want to reach him personally.

21:29.621 --> 21:30.622
There's a fire.

21:30.706 --> 21:32.582
-Fire?
-Hyosan High School, classroom 2-5.

21:32.666 --> 21:34.293
Hurry up. The fire is massive.

21:34.376 --> 21:36.211
[alarm blaring]

21:37.754 --> 21:39.756
[suspenseful music]

21:46.888 --> 21:49.057
[alarm blaring continues]

21:51.435 --> 21:54.980
GYEONGGI FIRE DEPARTMENT

21:55.063 --> 21:57.107
[sirens blaring]

21:57.858 --> 22:00.986
HYOSAN FIRE STATION

22:08.660 --> 22:11.580
RESCUE

22:11.663 --> 22:13.999
[sirens wailing]

22:19.671 --> 22:20.672
No one's coming?

22:22.924 --> 22:24.593
I think something's happening at the gate.

22:26.720 --> 22:28.055
Let's call the cops again.

22:28.680 --> 22:29.639
Get them to listen.

22:30.515 --> 22:32.184
I am, but they won't pick up.

22:32.267 --> 22:34.478
[breathing heavily]

22:36.897 --> 22:37.731
Hey.

22:38.732 --> 22:39.983
Do something.

22:40.567 --> 22:42.360
Tell Miss Park to come and help.

22:44.905 --> 22:45.947
Do something.

22:46.031 --> 22:47.199
Do what exactly?

22:48.075 --> 22:49.451
I don't know. Anything!

22:51.578 --> 22:53.497
What have you done as class president?

22:53.580 --> 22:54.915
-Stop it.
-Huh?

22:57.375 --> 22:58.502
[chair rasps]

22:59.878 --> 23:02.047
[dramatic music]

23:06.468 --> 23:09.513
Teacher's office?
So you just want me to leave now?

23:11.932 --> 23:13.558
Well, if you're offering.

23:14.059 --> 23:15.519
You told me to do something.

23:16.520 --> 23:17.896
Do you want me to leave?

23:18.438 --> 23:19.731
Stop it, you two.

23:20.774 --> 23:23.151
She's only saying that
because you're the class president.

23:23.235 --> 23:26.822
-Yeah. You are, right?
-So just be patient, okay?

23:29.991 --> 23:32.702
So stupid. Typical.

23:32.786 --> 23:34.287
What's typical?

23:34.913 --> 23:37.124
[dramatic music continues]

23:38.917 --> 23:42.337
Now that we are in this mess,
I'm your class president?

23:45.674 --> 23:48.385
We called the police,
so I'm sure we'll be fine soon.

23:48.468 --> 23:50.929
[groans]
But no one's coming!

23:51.012 --> 23:54.224
-Enough already. We're all scared too!
-That's why I'm telling them to call!

23:54.307 --> 23:55.934
Why don't you do it, then?

23:56.017 --> 23:58.353
Ladies, ladies,
can you just stop the whining?

23:58.436 --> 24:00.689
Oh, now you're butting in, shithead?

24:00.772 --> 24:02.482
What? Did you just call me a shithead?

24:03.233 --> 24:04.985
Call me a shithead, you shithead?

24:05.068 --> 24:07.070
[overlapping chatter]

24:08.196 --> 24:09.739
-Let it go.
-Stop it.

24:09.823 --> 24:12.033
Hold the door. I said hold the door.

24:12.617 --> 24:14.327
Who the hell does she think she is?

24:14.411 --> 24:15.745
-Stop it.
-[groans]

24:15.829 --> 24:18.915
-[Gyeong-su] Did you hear what she said?
-Gyeong-su. Come on. Hold the door.

24:18.999 --> 24:20.750
[Wu-jin] Let it go. It's nothing new.

24:20.834 --> 24:23.044
-Enough already. I'm going.
-Block it. Just go block it.

24:23.128 --> 24:25.547
-Fine. Seriously… Whoa!
-Shit!

24:25.630 --> 24:26.840
[door slams]

24:26.923 --> 24:28.925
[breathing heavily]

24:29.551 --> 24:30.552
Coach Kang.

24:30.635 --> 24:32.345
[panting]

24:33.763 --> 24:34.639
Are you guys okay?

24:37.434 --> 24:38.852
[sighs deeply]

24:40.395 --> 24:42.606
What about you? You weren't bitten?

24:42.689 --> 24:46.276
No. Of course not. I'm, I'm all right.

24:46.359 --> 24:49.279
Hey, guys. Let's block the door first.

24:50.655 --> 24:52.407
[Jin-gu] Get moving. Hurry.

24:52.490 --> 24:54.451
I'm fine. Let's move this.

24:54.534 --> 24:55.493
Like this?

24:55.577 --> 24:58.872
Yes, yes. Stack them high. High. High.

25:00.081 --> 25:02.292
Coach Kang? You called the cops, right?

25:02.375 --> 25:05.045
-You and the teachers. Help's coming.
-Yeah, sure.

25:05.587 --> 25:07.923
What are you doing? Move quickly.

25:08.006 --> 25:10.091
Stack it high. High.

25:10.175 --> 25:11.218
Here.

25:11.301 --> 25:13.637
-Stack it high.
-Higher?

25:13.720 --> 25:16.264
Push it closer. Much closer.

25:16.348 --> 25:17.224
[chair rasps]

25:18.350 --> 25:19.517
[whispers]
On-jo, look.

25:19.601 --> 25:20.560
What?

25:21.811 --> 25:23.980
There. His arm.

25:24.898 --> 25:26.900
[ominous music]

25:27.859 --> 25:28.985
Coach Kang.

25:29.945 --> 25:31.071
Your arm.

25:31.154 --> 25:33.156
What are you doing? Come help us.

25:33.698 --> 25:35.450
-You have a bite mark on your arm!
-Is this…

25:35.533 --> 25:36.910
What?

25:41.289 --> 25:43.041
-What is it?
-[Jin-gu] I wasn't bitten.

25:43.667 --> 25:45.627
-[Gyeong-su] He said he wasn't bitten.
-No, no. I…

25:46.544 --> 25:47.504
I, I wasn't bitten.

25:48.088 --> 25:49.256
It's a bite mark.

25:49.339 --> 25:51.549
I said it isn't.
Don't talk back to me. Okay?

25:51.633 --> 25:53.593
-It looks like you were really bitten.
-I wasn't!

25:53.677 --> 25:55.512
How many times must I tell you?

25:55.595 --> 25:58.306
Then why the hell are you hiding it?
Just show it to us.

25:58.390 --> 26:01.434
[suspenseful music]

26:01.518 --> 26:02.978
I think you should leave right now.

26:03.770 --> 26:05.772
-What?
-Get out of here immediately.

26:06.523 --> 26:08.608
You want me to go out there?

26:09.317 --> 26:12.195
After all I did to get here?
You want me to go back out?

26:12.279 --> 26:13.655
You were bitten.

26:14.239 --> 26:15.532
[I-sak] Come on. Get out.

26:17.951 --> 26:19.160
I said get out now!

26:19.244 --> 26:20.412
Cocksucker!

26:21.538 --> 26:23.248
How dare you yell at me like that?

26:24.416 --> 26:25.333
[Jin-gu] You little…

26:26.001 --> 26:26.876
Get over here.

26:27.377 --> 26:28.586
Come here.

26:29.629 --> 26:30.714
Now!

26:33.300 --> 26:35.385
-You won't come? Hey.
-[Dae-su] Hey, hey, hey.

26:35.468 --> 26:38.513
-Stop. Stop. Stop it.
-[Su-hyeok] He was bitten.

26:38.596 --> 26:40.640
-[Dae-su] Wait, wait, wait.
-Whoa, stay back.

26:41.308 --> 26:42.267
[Dae-su] Look.

26:42.350 --> 26:43.351
Let go.

26:44.894 --> 26:46.229
[On-jo grunts]

26:47.355 --> 26:49.357
[tense music]

26:54.821 --> 26:56.698
-You fucking bitch.
-[Su-hyeok] Watch it!

26:57.449 --> 26:59.451
-[gasps]
-Wait, wait.

26:59.534 --> 27:01.161
-Holy shit.
-I think he really was bitten.

27:01.244 --> 27:03.246
Guys, we should get out of here
as soon as possible.

27:03.330 --> 27:04.831
Hey. Hey. He's turning.

27:04.914 --> 27:06.374
[bones crunching]

27:06.458 --> 27:09.711
Get him out of here! Hurry!

27:09.794 --> 27:11.671
[Na-yeon] Hurry. Throw him out.

27:11.755 --> 27:13.757
[growling]

27:13.840 --> 27:16.051
[tense music]

27:17.344 --> 27:18.386
[whimpers]

27:18.470 --> 27:20.597
-[Gyeong-su] Do something!
-[screams]

27:20.680 --> 27:23.767
-No! Dae-su!
-[grunts]

27:23.850 --> 27:28.355
-[growling]
-[yells]

27:33.109 --> 27:34.319
[Ji-min] Min-ji…

27:34.402 --> 27:36.654
[Jin-gu growling]

27:36.738 --> 27:40.408
Dae-su. I can't…

27:41.618 --> 27:43.036
[Min-ji] I don't want to die.

27:43.119 --> 27:44.204
[bones crunching]

27:44.287 --> 27:45.872
[snarling]

27:46.915 --> 27:48.416
[Na-yeon screams]

27:48.500 --> 27:51.044
[Na-yeon] Get him… Get him out of here!

27:51.127 --> 27:52.212
[grunts]

27:52.295 --> 27:54.339
-[Jin-gu snarling]
-[grunting]

28:00.428 --> 28:02.722
-[snarls]
-[grunting]

28:06.101 --> 28:06.935
Cheong-san!

28:11.189 --> 28:12.482
[Min-ji] I don't want to die.

28:12.565 --> 28:14.692
Help me.
[sobs]

28:17.237 --> 28:19.280
[dramatic music]

28:20.323 --> 28:22.200
[clattering]

28:22.283 --> 28:24.661
[dramatic music continues]

28:27.914 --> 28:30.375
[Min-ji pants]

28:34.462 --> 28:35.797
Don't come closer.

28:35.880 --> 28:38.675
-Get away from me. No!
-[whimpers]

28:40.593 --> 28:43.221
-[choking]
-[bones crunching]

28:47.434 --> 28:48.685
[gasps]

28:49.519 --> 28:51.354
[screeches]

28:52.480 --> 28:54.816
[breathing heavily]

28:54.899 --> 28:56.568
[screeches]

28:57.777 --> 29:01.197
[straining]
Stop it. Step out of the club, please.

29:01.281 --> 29:02.490
We gotta go.

29:02.574 --> 29:05.076
[zombies growling]

29:05.160 --> 29:06.494
Get out! Get out!

29:07.537 --> 29:10.165
-Let's go!
-Go, Cheong-san! Dae-su!

29:13.168 --> 29:14.502
Hurry!

29:14.586 --> 29:16.254
-[snarls]
-[grunts]

29:16.337 --> 29:17.547
[Hyo-ryeong] Hurry!

29:18.590 --> 29:19.507
Get out!

29:19.591 --> 29:20.508
Gyeong-su!

29:24.596 --> 29:26.806
-[screams]
-[gasps]

29:31.144 --> 29:33.146
[thrilling music]

29:33.938 --> 29:36.775
-[whimpering]
-[snarls]

29:36.858 --> 29:38.067
[all gasp]

29:38.818 --> 29:40.278
[snarling]

29:41.613 --> 29:42.822
[girls scream]

29:46.159 --> 29:48.203
[thrilling music continues]

29:51.414 --> 29:52.832
[glass shatters]

29:58.254 --> 29:59.714
[grunts]

30:00.381 --> 30:02.717
[screaming]

30:02.801 --> 30:04.636
[panting]

30:06.554 --> 30:08.681
-[girls scream]
-[grunts]

30:13.019 --> 30:16.231
[grunting]

30:16.314 --> 30:18.358
[thrilling music]

30:21.277 --> 30:22.111
Watch your hands!

30:22.195 --> 30:24.280
-[screaming]
-Watch out!

30:26.699 --> 30:28.535
Hey! Get out of the way!

30:28.618 --> 30:30.620
[action music]

30:39.796 --> 30:42.590
[action music rises]

30:50.515 --> 30:53.268
[screams]

31:00.608 --> 31:02.068
[Wu-jin] Hey! Come!

31:05.071 --> 31:06.072
Come on, girls! Come on!

31:07.448 --> 31:08.700
Push it!

31:08.783 --> 31:09.826
Let's go!

31:10.743 --> 31:12.203
[Wu-jin] Keep pushing!

31:13.413 --> 31:14.414
[Na-yeon] Push!

31:14.497 --> 31:16.499
[action music]

31:18.167 --> 31:19.335
Get out of here!

31:19.419 --> 31:20.920
Girls, upstairs!

31:21.754 --> 31:22.672
Let's go!

31:28.052 --> 31:28.970
Hurry up!

31:34.309 --> 31:36.019
[snarls]

31:40.023 --> 31:41.524
No! No! Get back!

31:43.318 --> 31:45.653
-[all whimpering]
-Back! Back! Back!

31:45.737 --> 31:46.946
[grunts]

31:48.656 --> 31:51.242
[screaming]

31:52.493 --> 31:54.621
[action music continues]

31:56.414 --> 31:57.415
[whimpers]

32:00.001 --> 32:02.462
-Su-hyeok!
-Get to the lab!

32:03.171 --> 32:04.339
Hurry!

32:04.422 --> 32:06.507
[snarling]

32:06.591 --> 32:07.550
[grunts]

32:07.634 --> 32:09.636
[action music fades]

32:15.808 --> 32:17.143
Dae-su! Watch out!

32:17.226 --> 32:18.478
[shrieks]

32:21.814 --> 32:23.483
Help me. Help!

32:24.609 --> 32:25.443
Push!

32:26.110 --> 32:26.945
Push!

32:27.028 --> 32:29.030
[tense music]

32:30.448 --> 32:32.617
-Push!
-Harder!

32:33.368 --> 32:35.244
-[clanks]
-It's locked. Gotta go somewhere else!

32:35.328 --> 32:36.913
Nowhere to go! We're surrounded!

32:36.996 --> 32:39.040
-It's locked! Didn't you hear me?
-[Wu-jin] What now?

32:41.334 --> 32:42.877
[Na-yeon] Try to open it!

32:42.961 --> 32:45.672
-[I-sak] Can't you see it's locked?
-[Cheong-san] Hey, block the hole!

32:46.214 --> 32:47.090
Dae-su, push!

32:47.840 --> 32:48.925
[Cheong-san] Push!

32:49.008 --> 32:51.636
[students grunting]

32:53.763 --> 32:55.932
[grunting]

32:59.769 --> 33:02.897
[Wu-jin] Hey, hey, hey! Careful!
Watch your hands!

33:05.400 --> 33:06.651
Why is it taking so long?

33:06.734 --> 33:09.696
-Hey!
-[growling]

33:09.779 --> 33:13.074
-[Na-yeon] Above you!
-[Gyeong-su] Hey, it's climbing over!

33:13.157 --> 33:14.575
-[glass shatters]
-[Na-yeon screams]

33:16.244 --> 33:19.205
[Dae-su] I can't hold them off
much longer. Hurry up!

33:19.956 --> 33:21.249
It's open!

33:22.375 --> 33:24.127
-Go!
-[Cheong-san] Push!

33:24.711 --> 33:25.878
Push!

33:25.962 --> 33:29.340
[zombies snarling]

33:30.008 --> 33:31.759
Hurry! Hurry! Go in!

33:32.719 --> 33:33.761
[glass shatters]

33:34.929 --> 33:36.139
Hurry!

33:38.891 --> 33:40.601
[shouting]

33:41.561 --> 33:44.188
-[snarling]
-[whimpering]

33:44.272 --> 33:47.358
[zombies snarling]

33:47.442 --> 33:50.194
[thumping]

33:58.619 --> 34:00.705
Oh, shit.
[screams]

34:00.788 --> 34:02.248
[Dae-su] Oh, damn it!

34:02.331 --> 34:04.917
[Dae-su whimpering]

34:05.001 --> 34:06.044
[growls]

34:07.211 --> 34:09.297
[grunting]

34:15.178 --> 34:16.929
[glass shatters]

34:17.013 --> 34:18.222
[whimpers]

34:20.266 --> 34:22.685
[crying]

34:24.729 --> 34:25.855
[glasses clatter]

34:26.439 --> 34:28.900
-Get a desk!
-[grunts]

34:29.484 --> 34:30.818
Block it!

34:35.656 --> 34:36.783
Block it.

34:36.866 --> 34:37.825
[growls]

34:37.909 --> 34:40.328
[suspenseful music]

34:52.632 --> 34:54.884
Give me the phone.
I'm gonna try calling again.

34:54.967 --> 34:56.594
Sorry, I lost it.

34:57.178 --> 34:58.721
How could you lose it?

34:59.514 --> 35:01.474
Who cares? We got a secured room now.

35:03.059 --> 35:04.769
Like you can talk.

35:07.021 --> 35:09.398
-What?
-It's because you didn't lock the door.

35:09.482 --> 35:12.610
If you had done that, the gym teacher
wouldn't have gotten to us.

35:12.693 --> 35:14.362
[Na-yeon] We almost died because of you.

35:14.445 --> 35:16.364
Then why didn't you do anything yourself?

35:17.406 --> 35:18.741
You're so fucking annoying.

35:18.825 --> 35:20.368
Gyeong-su, no, no, no. Hey, don't.

35:20.451 --> 35:23.079
-You bitch.
-Don't you touch me!

35:23.162 --> 35:26.415
Fight after you move these.
This is not the time.

35:26.499 --> 35:28.167
She's right. Stop it.

35:28.251 --> 35:30.336
Yeah, fight after we finish this.
Gyeong-su.

35:32.046 --> 35:35.424
Ugh! This is so fucking annoying!

35:37.260 --> 35:38.261
[grunts]

35:38.344 --> 35:40.513
[dramatic music]

35:50.565 --> 35:51.858
Su-hyeok?

35:52.650 --> 35:54.152
[On-jo] Has anyone seen him?

35:56.779 --> 35:58.114
You were with him, right?

36:00.116 --> 36:01.909
He was behind me.

36:01.993 --> 36:03.327
Then where is he now?

36:06.664 --> 36:07.707
I don't know.

36:10.126 --> 36:12.128
[ominous music]

36:18.176 --> 36:20.011
[snarling]

36:24.307 --> 36:28.144
[distant screaming]

36:31.939 --> 36:34.525
[distant growling]

36:38.446 --> 36:39.322
They've all turned.

36:40.198 --> 36:43.701
I think everyone except us turned.

36:44.952 --> 36:46.287
We're outcasts again.

36:49.707 --> 36:51.626
-[screaming]
-[snarling]

36:53.920 --> 36:55.129
And this is still hell.

36:58.132 --> 36:59.634
[Eun-ji] I hope everyone dies.

37:00.843 --> 37:02.178
Every single one of them.

37:03.596 --> 37:07.600
-[growling]
-[quivering]

37:07.683 --> 37:10.686
-[whimpering]
-Shh! Shut the fuck up!

37:10.770 --> 37:13.397
[snarling]

37:13.481 --> 37:15.900
[lady whimpering]

37:16.984 --> 37:18.611
-[grumbles]
-[screams]

37:24.784 --> 37:27.870
-[zombie growls]
-[lady screaming]

37:28.829 --> 37:33.834
[flesh squelching]

37:34.961 --> 37:37.004
[tense music]

37:43.678 --> 37:44.804
[huffs]

37:46.305 --> 37:48.349
[Joon-seong]
We should stay here a bit longer.

37:48.432 --> 37:49.809
[Ha-lim] Right. Okay.

37:51.352 --> 37:52.895
[Joon-seong] Do you think they're gone?

37:52.979 --> 37:55.564
[Ha-lim] What do we do?
Shouldn't we go out and call the cops?

37:55.648 --> 37:58.985
We can't go out now.
I'm sure they're still out there.

37:59.068 --> 38:00.236
[sniffs]

38:00.987 --> 38:02.113
[Ha-lim sighs]

38:02.196 --> 38:05.741
Also, who the heck is smoking
in here right now?

38:05.825 --> 38:08.494
And who are you that you're hiding
in the girls' bathroom, huh?

38:09.370 --> 38:11.289
Be a man. If you can even do that.

38:11.872 --> 38:13.499
You… Who are you?

38:14.250 --> 38:16.836
Leave her alone. It's Mi-jin.

38:16.919 --> 38:18.796
Mi-jin? Park Mi-jin?

38:18.879 --> 38:19.755
[Ha-lim] Yeah.

38:20.756 --> 38:23.884
Joon-seong. I'm really dizzy.

38:25.469 --> 38:26.470
[Joon-seong] Is it bad?

38:27.346 --> 38:29.974
-Oh, no.
-I don't know. It's weird.

38:30.725 --> 38:33.644
[Ha-lim] Everything sounds muffled,
and I'm dizzy.

38:35.021 --> 38:37.648
[Joon-seong] Don't worry,
it's probably just from the shock.

38:37.732 --> 38:40.109
We'll go to the hospital
when things calm down, okay?

38:40.192 --> 38:41.694
-[lock clanks]
-Okay.

38:42.403 --> 38:44.572
-[banging on door]
-What is it? Who is it?

38:44.655 --> 38:45.740
Hey, open up.

38:47.199 --> 38:49.285
-Open up. Come on!
-What do you…

38:49.368 --> 38:50.202
[lock clanks]

38:50.286 --> 38:51.662
-Get out.
-What's wrong with you?

38:51.746 --> 38:53.331
-Stay still.
-[whimpers]

38:53.414 --> 38:54.790
What's going on?

38:57.084 --> 38:58.210
[groans]

39:00.046 --> 39:03.007
-What are you doing?
-I said to stay still, you moron!

39:03.090 --> 39:04.383
Mi-jin.
[whimpers]

39:05.176 --> 39:06.594
Listen carefully.

39:08.137 --> 39:09.305
You know how to play tag?

39:10.639 --> 39:11.807
[Mi-jin] We hide.

39:11.891 --> 39:14.435
We run to get away from someone.

39:15.019 --> 39:15.978
Now…

39:19.523 --> 39:21.025
Now, you are it.

39:21.108 --> 39:23.444
[whimpers]

39:23.527 --> 39:25.529
[eerie music]

39:36.749 --> 39:38.250
[breathes deeply]

39:45.591 --> 39:48.094
[panting]

39:53.891 --> 39:55.559
Don't stand there! Help!

39:55.643 --> 39:57.311
But Ha-lim's in there.

39:57.395 --> 40:00.272
She was bitten. You got that? Now, help.

40:00.356 --> 40:02.358
[grunting]

40:02.441 --> 40:03.901
[Ha-lim] Mi-jin, don't do this.

40:04.402 --> 40:05.820
I'm okay.

40:07.154 --> 40:08.322
Let me out.

40:08.989 --> 40:10.658
Shut up, zombie fucker!

40:10.741 --> 40:12.243
[Ha-lim] Joon-seong, don't do this.

40:12.326 --> 40:13.494
Let me out.

40:14.370 --> 40:17.540
We ran away together earlier. I saved you.

40:20.543 --> 40:22.002
If you let her out, we all die.

40:22.795 --> 40:24.922
[eerie music continues]

40:30.511 --> 40:31.804
Shit. Shit!

40:33.806 --> 40:35.474
Get it together. Look up.

40:35.558 --> 40:37.393
What do you want from me?

40:37.476 --> 40:40.146
-We have to kill her.
-Kill Ha-lim?

40:40.229 --> 40:43.357
She's not Ha-lim. She's a… zombie.

40:43.441 --> 40:45.818
-[groaning]
-[Joon-seong] Still, I don't wanna.

40:45.901 --> 40:48.028
[Mi-jin] Do we have any other options?

40:49.864 --> 40:51.282
[Joon-seong] I don't know.

40:53.033 --> 40:55.995
Mi-jin. I hear you.

40:56.078 --> 40:57.163
I know.

40:57.955 --> 41:00.458
[Ha-lim] Do you really have
to do that to me?

41:00.541 --> 41:01.876
You're going to turn, eventually.

41:03.627 --> 41:07.882
-I know. But you…
-[bones crunching]

41:07.965 --> 41:11.469
I will kill you first.
[choking]

41:12.386 --> 41:14.221
I'll kill you before anyone else.

41:15.347 --> 41:16.265
Bitch.

41:17.141 --> 41:18.976
[Ha-lim sobs]

41:19.059 --> 41:19.935
[Ha-lim] Mi-jin.

41:21.896 --> 41:23.856
-[bones crunch]
-I… I'm so scared.

41:23.939 --> 41:24.773
[gasps]

41:30.279 --> 41:37.286
[snarling]

41:39.538 --> 41:40.623
[grunts]

41:43.125 --> 41:44.001
Get ready.

41:45.961 --> 41:47.171
I said to get ready.

41:47.254 --> 41:48.380
For what?

41:49.089 --> 41:50.132
We gotta kill her.

41:52.343 --> 41:54.428
[suspenseful music]

41:55.888 --> 41:57.389
Are you gonna hold that forever?

41:57.473 --> 41:59.558
[snarling]

42:01.352 --> 42:03.479
[creaking]

42:09.693 --> 42:11.237
-[growls]
-[grunts]

42:12.279 --> 42:14.490
-[squelching]
-[Joon-seong whimpers]

42:14.573 --> 42:15.866
[choking]

42:15.950 --> 42:17.451
Damn it.

42:17.535 --> 42:18.869
What are you doing?

42:18.953 --> 42:21.038
[whimpering]

42:23.290 --> 42:25.125
Why won't she die?

42:25.626 --> 42:27.461
I don't know.
Maybe it's not the right spot.

42:28.087 --> 42:29.171
-[thumps]
-[gasps]

42:29.255 --> 42:31.465
[snarling]

42:34.051 --> 42:34.927
[shrieks]

42:35.010 --> 42:36.178
-[body thuds]
-[Mi-jin] What…

42:40.474 --> 42:42.768
-[both gasp]
-Stop. Not us. We're fine.

42:42.851 --> 42:43.936
[squeaks]

42:44.019 --> 42:46.105
Not us, jackass!

42:47.940 --> 42:50.067
Hey, I think they're okay.

42:50.150 --> 42:51.193
Zombies don't curse.

42:52.194 --> 42:53.112
Shoot if they turn.

42:54.363 --> 42:56.490
-You crazy bitch. We're fine--
-[speaker squeals]

42:56.574 --> 42:58.367
[groans]

42:59.743 --> 43:02.329
Students and teachers
of Hyosan High School.

43:02.413 --> 43:04.540
I'm Park Sun-hwa, the English teacher.

43:05.165 --> 43:08.377
Something strange is happening
throughout the school.

43:09.920 --> 43:14.049
[Sun-hwa] Some students
are attacking others indiscriminately.

43:14.800 --> 43:17.511
So please flee and find a safe place.

43:18.053 --> 43:21.724
And if any student
or faculty hears this and is able to,

43:21.807 --> 43:24.393
please call the police
and the fire department.

43:26.353 --> 43:30.441
Students, hide somewhere safe
until help arrives.

43:31.734 --> 43:34.236
If you can get out of the school,

43:34.320 --> 43:36.155
please get out.

43:37.072 --> 43:38.407
I'll say it again.

43:39.575 --> 43:41.577
Some students are…

43:42.620 --> 43:46.832
[muffled growling]

43:48.250 --> 43:50.544
[dramatic music]

43:52.671 --> 43:53.964
Hey, everyone…

43:55.549 --> 43:57.676
You're okay, right?

43:58.302 --> 43:59.678
[Sun-hwa] You're not hurt?

44:01.597 --> 44:02.765
I don't know

44:03.641 --> 44:06.894
what's going on in here
or how this whole thing happened, but…

44:07.936 --> 44:11.523
Still, find a safe place and hide.

44:12.650 --> 44:14.610
[dramatic music continues]

44:18.739 --> 44:21.241
I… I'm sorry…

44:22.368 --> 44:25.204
I can't help.
[Sun-hwa sobbing]

44:26.622 --> 44:28.791
Don't get hurt, okay?

44:30.000 --> 44:33.253
Please, let's stay alive and meet again.

44:34.213 --> 44:35.130
Okay?

44:35.881 --> 44:37.883
[dramatic music]

44:46.058 --> 44:48.477
[dispatcher 3] Rescue Team Three,
head to Hyosan Hospital.

44:48.560 --> 44:50.771
Team Four, head to the accident
at Hyosan Intersection.

44:50.854 --> 44:53.065
Team Two, you have another call.

44:53.148 --> 44:55.901
Fire, Hyosan High School.
Please head there right away.

44:56.610 --> 44:58.112
Ambulance One, stay where you are.

44:59.154 --> 45:01.615
Team One. We've arrived at the accident.

45:02.241 --> 45:05.369
[rescuer 1] Rescue Team Two. We'll head
to the accident at Hyosan High School.

45:05.953 --> 45:07.746
[dispatcher 4]
Accident reports keep coming in.

45:07.830 --> 45:09.289
All units, standby where you are.

45:09.373 --> 45:10.791
[sirens wailing]

45:13.669 --> 45:15.712
[suspenseful music]

45:21.427 --> 45:23.011
[distant clanging]

45:24.763 --> 45:26.765
[tense music]

45:27.683 --> 45:30.185
[crow squawking]

45:34.898 --> 45:36.066
Let's go.

45:36.150 --> 45:38.235
[tense music continues]

45:41.447 --> 45:44.283
[whimpering]

45:44.366 --> 45:45.784
[groaning]

45:49.413 --> 45:50.581
Fuck you!

45:51.790 --> 45:53.208
-Why'd you do that?
-There was a fly.

45:53.292 --> 45:54.334
[music stops]

46:00.716 --> 46:02.593
You talked to On-jo, right?

46:03.260 --> 46:04.887
She told Su-hyeok she likes him.

46:06.138 --> 46:06.972
Okay, so?

46:08.307 --> 46:09.725
Why don't you go and comfort her?

46:10.726 --> 46:12.478
I keep trying, but you know.

46:13.353 --> 46:14.229
No, forget it.

46:15.772 --> 46:16.940
Why are you getting annoyed?

46:17.774 --> 46:20.527
What does it have to be
my business who she likes?

46:23.906 --> 46:25.324
Never mind.
[sighs]

46:26.825 --> 46:28.827
[footsteps receding]

46:30.078 --> 46:32.331
[birds chirping]

46:34.666 --> 46:35.584
On-jo.

46:36.335 --> 46:37.669
Don't worry too much.

46:39.588 --> 46:41.298
I'm sure Su-hyeok will be just fine.

46:41.840 --> 46:44.134
He's a great athlete and super fast.

46:47.221 --> 46:48.180
Mm-hm.

46:51.934 --> 46:54.520
[birds chirping]

46:56.730 --> 46:57.648
But…

46:58.690 --> 47:00.901
Cheong-san's being super weird.

47:00.984 --> 47:02.444
He's so annoying.

47:03.695 --> 47:07.908
I think… he's so into you.

47:08.408 --> 47:10.369
It's totally obvious!

47:10.452 --> 47:13.747
I don't think so.
He doesn't feel things like that.

47:14.748 --> 47:17.125
He's too busy teasing me all the time.

47:18.669 --> 47:21.463
[dramatic music]

47:29.888 --> 47:30.973
I-sak.

47:31.932 --> 47:33.141
Why are you so cold?

47:34.393 --> 47:35.269
So cold?

47:38.647 --> 47:40.065
Your hand is really…

47:44.319 --> 47:45.362
What about my hand?

47:50.117 --> 47:52.744
[growling]

47:52.828 --> 47:54.621
[groaning]

47:55.497 --> 47:56.456
I-sak.

47:57.291 --> 48:00.794
-What's wrong? Are you--
-Really. I wasn't bitten.

48:03.797 --> 48:05.424
I mean it. I really wasn't bitten.

48:06.925 --> 48:08.468
She was bitten.

48:08.552 --> 48:10.804
[suspenseful music]

48:13.181 --> 48:14.558
[Na-yeon] What's going on?

48:16.101 --> 48:17.060
Did you get bitten?

48:17.144 --> 48:18.312
I said I wasn't!

48:21.607 --> 48:24.443
Hey. Are you okay?

48:24.526 --> 48:26.528
[suspenseful music continues]

48:35.370 --> 48:36.204
On-jo.

48:37.748 --> 48:38.624
I-sak.

48:47.549 --> 48:48.842
No, right?

48:49.926 --> 48:51.053
I'm not, right?

48:52.387 --> 48:54.765
[suspenseful music]

48:58.477 --> 48:59.519
I'm not.

49:00.437 --> 49:01.647
I'm not one of them.

49:04.816 --> 49:06.443
[sobs]

49:09.655 --> 49:12.616
What are you doing?
Get her out of here right now!

49:13.367 --> 49:15.994
Shit. They're going to climb over.

49:16.995 --> 49:17.871
No.

49:18.664 --> 49:20.165
Come on. I said I'm okay.

49:20.248 --> 49:22.584
[suspenseful music continues]

49:31.718 --> 49:32.803
On-jo.

49:33.428 --> 49:34.680
Let go.

49:35.639 --> 49:36.640
[gasps]

49:36.723 --> 49:37.933
[bone crunches]

49:39.476 --> 49:41.061
Hurry up! Do something!

49:42.104 --> 49:44.356
-[Na-yeon] Throw her out the window.
-[groaning]

49:44.439 --> 49:46.358
-No. Let go.
-[gasping]

49:46.441 --> 49:48.485
Hurry! She's turning into a zombie!

49:51.488 --> 49:52.614
I-sak, please don't.

49:55.742 --> 50:00.455
[bones crunching]

50:05.127 --> 50:07.212
[breathing heavily]

50:08.088 --> 50:09.339
[On-jo] I-sak.

50:10.632 --> 50:12.592
I-sak, don't do this.

50:12.676 --> 50:14.970
-[growls]
-[whimpers]

50:17.055 --> 50:17.973
Stop it!

50:19.683 --> 50:20.642
Stop it, please!

50:20.726 --> 50:21.810
[grunts]

50:24.813 --> 50:25.897
Cheong-san!

50:28.442 --> 50:29.735
[glass shatters]

50:31.528 --> 50:32.612
[snarling]

50:34.531 --> 50:36.158
[grunting]

50:37.033 --> 50:38.160
[Cheong-san] Are you crazy?

50:38.785 --> 50:40.078
-Let go.
-[On-jo] I-sak.

50:40.162 --> 50:41.496
[Cheong-san] You have to let go.

50:41.580 --> 50:42.831
[sobbing]

50:43.665 --> 50:46.251
[growling]

50:46.334 --> 50:50.172
[sobbing]

50:54.384 --> 50:55.427
You want some glitter?

50:55.510 --> 50:56.887
[chuckles]

50:56.970 --> 50:58.430
-It's fine. I can do it, okay?
-Go on.

50:58.513 --> 50:59.514
I'll do it for you.

51:02.517 --> 51:03.435
It's good. Look.

51:04.519 --> 51:05.937
[both chuckle]

51:06.021 --> 51:08.023
[sobbing]

51:09.316 --> 51:11.651
[somber music]

51:12.944 --> 51:14.863
-It looks great on you!
-[laughing]

51:16.114 --> 51:16.948
Get ready.

51:17.032 --> 51:19.701
[both chuckling]

51:21.286 --> 51:23.705
[somber music continues]

51:27.250 --> 51:28.710
[both laugh]

51:32.798 --> 51:34.800
[somber music]

51:39.513 --> 51:43.058
-[I-sak snarling]
-[sobbing]

51:45.185 --> 51:46.228
Hey!

51:47.813 --> 51:48.772
Here!

51:49.314 --> 51:51.900
[grunting]

51:54.236 --> 51:56.238
[grunting]

52:00.659 --> 52:02.661
-[Cheong-san grunts]
-[chair thuds]

52:04.871 --> 52:06.998
[somber music continues]

52:09.251 --> 52:11.253
[muffled growling]

52:15.966 --> 52:17.175
[body splatters]

52:18.468 --> 52:20.470
[somber music]

52:37.988 --> 52:40.532
[somber music continues]

52:48.957 --> 52:49.875
On-jo.

52:56.756 --> 53:00.051
[sobbing]

53:00.135 --> 53:02.470
[somber music]

53:10.812 --> 53:12.606
Come block this!

53:15.275 --> 53:19.362
[growling]

53:24.534 --> 53:26.453
[growling continues]

53:36.963 --> 53:38.965
[suspenseful music]

53:39.049 --> 53:42.469
[snarling]

53:44.888 --> 53:46.806
[growling]

53:49.059 --> 53:50.977
[music fades]

53:54.189 --> 53:56.733
[distant snarling]

54:01.488 --> 54:03.823
[soft suspenseful music]

54:13.041 --> 54:14.334
[thumping]

54:14.417 --> 54:16.795
[suspenseful music continues]

54:23.969 --> 54:24.928
[Cheong-san] Let's go.

54:25.971 --> 54:27.430
We're not gonna last here longer.

54:27.514 --> 54:28.598
Where would we go?

54:29.349 --> 54:30.892
The hose from earlier.

54:30.976 --> 54:31.893
[Cheong-san] Gyeong-su.

54:33.061 --> 54:33.979
Yeah?

54:36.064 --> 54:37.107
What?

54:39.442 --> 54:40.610
What is it?

54:40.694 --> 54:43.321
Open it just a few inches.
Enough for the hose to fit.

54:43.405 --> 54:45.573
Isn't it better to wait
for the rescuers to come save us?

54:45.657 --> 54:47.283
We might all die by the time they arrive.

54:47.367 --> 54:49.411
This will kill us faster.
It's just gonna be--

54:49.494 --> 54:51.705
Is waiting for someone to save us
the best thing we can do?

54:53.039 --> 54:54.207
Oh, whatever.

54:54.290 --> 54:56.835
If I turn into zombie… You're so mad.

54:56.918 --> 55:00.171
[muffled growling]

55:03.550 --> 55:05.552
[tense music]

55:18.356 --> 55:20.608
[tense music continues]

55:25.905 --> 55:27.282
[thudding]

55:31.453 --> 55:33.371
[clatters]

55:34.873 --> 55:37.584
[snarling]

55:38.918 --> 55:41.546
[tense music]

55:46.926 --> 55:47.844
Did you get it?

55:48.386 --> 55:49.637
Hey!

55:55.101 --> 55:57.645
[tense music continues]

56:05.987 --> 56:09.449
[clattering]

56:10.909 --> 56:13.703
[tense music]

56:15.705 --> 56:17.874
[grunting]

56:24.130 --> 56:26.299
[tense music continues]

56:30.136 --> 56:32.222
[hose rasping]

56:34.557 --> 56:35.809
Nam-ra, the door.

56:43.733 --> 56:44.734
Help me make some knots.

56:45.401 --> 56:46.444
How do you want it?

56:46.528 --> 56:50.573
Wrap it and tie it.
So a hand or foot can fit.

56:50.657 --> 56:52.033
You said big enough for a foot?

56:52.117 --> 56:55.370
Zigzag. Make it a zigzag.
Big enough increments.

56:55.453 --> 56:57.497
-Zigzag.
-Is this right?

56:58.164 --> 56:59.124
We need more.

57:01.751 --> 57:02.919
This is good, right?

57:07.090 --> 57:08.174
Let's go.

57:09.300 --> 57:11.386
[tense music]

57:13.930 --> 57:16.432
[distant screaming]

57:18.685 --> 57:20.019
Are we gonna make it down there?

57:20.603 --> 57:23.481
I'll go down and check the empty rooms.
I'll call when it's clear, okay?

57:23.565 --> 57:24.441
Okay.

57:25.024 --> 57:25.984
[Gyeong-su] Be careful.

57:27.527 --> 57:28.403
Hold it.

57:30.280 --> 57:31.489
What are you doing?

57:34.075 --> 57:35.076
What is it?

57:36.661 --> 57:37.745
Come on. Go down, dude.

57:38.788 --> 57:39.873
[distant scream]

57:40.623 --> 57:41.583
What?

57:42.542 --> 57:45.044
Gyeong-su, you go first.

57:45.128 --> 57:46.921
Why? Did you see something?

57:47.005 --> 57:48.756
No. But you go first.

57:48.840 --> 57:50.133
[Gyeong-su] What's down there?

57:51.342 --> 57:52.427
Just go.

57:52.510 --> 57:55.263
-You go. Go up there.
-[Ji-min] Go already.

57:55.346 --> 57:56.306
[Wu-jin] You should go.

57:56.389 --> 57:57.640
Then you go, okay?

57:57.724 --> 57:58.683
No. You can do it.

57:58.766 --> 58:00.477
-Man, you can do it.
-Fuck.

58:02.145 --> 58:03.605
But why… why am I…

58:03.688 --> 58:04.856
Grab it and go.

58:06.608 --> 58:07.859
Rock, paper, scissors?

58:07.942 --> 58:10.028
-Just go. Come on.
-I mean…

58:10.111 --> 58:11.529
Cowboy. Shit. God.

58:12.780 --> 58:14.365
[Gyeong-su] Where is it? Hold on.

58:14.449 --> 58:16.201
Wait, I can't reach it.

58:16.284 --> 58:18.495
-[Wu-jin] Put your foot in.
-[Gyeong-su] Oh, I got it.

58:18.578 --> 58:19.954
-Ohh.
-[Wu-jin] Careful.

58:20.038 --> 58:21.331
Okay.

58:23.416 --> 58:25.251
-[grunts]
-[hose squeaking]

58:26.711 --> 58:28.880
-[tense music]
-[grunting]

58:32.759 --> 58:34.511
[Gyeong-su] Damn it. Where is it?

58:36.846 --> 58:39.682
[grunting]

58:39.766 --> 58:41.851
[tense music continues]

58:46.731 --> 58:48.775
Oh, shit. Okay, shit. Fuck.

58:49.651 --> 58:50.944
Damn it.

58:54.405 --> 58:55.406
I'll go down.

59:11.339 --> 59:12.465
I wanna go down first.

59:13.591 --> 59:16.511
One person at a time.
You might fall if it shakes too much.

59:16.594 --> 59:18.179
[Na-yeon] Well, I won't shake it then.

59:19.222 --> 59:21.808
-How long do you want me to wait?
-Just a little bit.

59:21.891 --> 59:24.561
[grunting]

59:28.690 --> 59:30.900
Shit. Why won't it come out?

59:32.652 --> 59:34.696
Gyeong-su! Gyeong-su!

59:34.779 --> 59:35.822
Ms. Park!

59:35.905 --> 59:37.156
Gyeong-su!

59:37.240 --> 59:39.075
-Are you okay?
-Quickly. Hurry.

59:39.158 --> 59:40.785
-Be careful.
-Oh, right.

59:41.744 --> 59:42.620
Cheong-san!

59:42.704 --> 59:44.289
Hey, guys! Miss Park is here!

59:44.998 --> 59:46.499
Miss Park is on the second floor.

59:46.583 --> 59:48.543
The second floor? Broadcasting room?

59:48.626 --> 59:50.253
-Are you okay?
-Yeah.

59:50.336 --> 59:52.338
Were you with the other kids
by any chance?

59:52.422 --> 59:54.882
They're in the science lab.
They'll come down now.

59:54.966 --> 59:56.968
Come down! Okay?

59:57.760 --> 59:58.845
[Gyeong-su] Come down!

59:58.928 --> 01:00:00.054
Seriously!

01:00:01.472 --> 01:00:02.390
What?

01:00:03.474 --> 01:00:06.102
Careful. Careful. I got you.
Hold on. Hold on.

01:00:08.646 --> 01:00:09.647
You're so heavy.

01:00:09.731 --> 01:00:11.190
-Dae-su.
-Miss Park.

01:00:13.526 --> 01:00:14.694
Be soon.

01:00:14.777 --> 01:00:16.821
[tense music]

01:00:25.997 --> 01:00:27.999
[grunting]

01:00:29.667 --> 01:00:31.252
Grab the window frame. Okay.

01:00:31.336 --> 01:00:32.337
-Grab her.
-I got you.

01:00:32.420 --> 01:00:33.671
Let go.

01:00:33.755 --> 01:00:34.881
-I have a cramp!
-You okay?

01:00:34.964 --> 01:00:36.174
[groaning]

01:00:36.257 --> 01:00:37.634
-Ah, shit.
-Straighten your knee.

01:00:37.717 --> 01:00:39.510
-Not my legs!
-Watch out for your neck!

01:00:39.594 --> 01:00:42.347
Good. You did great. You did great.
[sighs]

01:00:42.430 --> 01:00:44.474
[tense music continues]

01:00:46.184 --> 01:00:47.352
[thumping]

01:00:48.019 --> 01:00:50.772
[snarling]

01:00:55.985 --> 01:00:58.279
[tense music]

01:01:00.823 --> 01:01:03.117
[snarling]

01:01:11.125 --> 01:01:12.085
[Cheong-san] Go down.

01:01:16.172 --> 01:01:17.006
I-sak…

01:01:17.090 --> 01:01:18.549
You have to get it together.

01:01:19.634 --> 01:01:21.803
Everyone in here lost a friend, On-jo.

01:01:21.886 --> 01:01:24.180
Do you know how many people died?
Why are you so…

01:01:24.263 --> 01:01:26.349
There's just no one left that I like.

01:01:30.019 --> 01:01:33.523
Well, there are people who like you.

01:01:34.899 --> 01:01:35.942
Like your dad.

01:01:36.025 --> 01:01:38.319
[soft music]

01:01:40.321 --> 01:01:41.989
You have to stay alive for them.

01:01:49.414 --> 01:01:50.581
Let's go.

01:01:51.582 --> 01:01:53.584
[soft music continues]

01:01:57.422 --> 01:02:00.133
[gasping]

01:02:05.012 --> 01:02:07.432
[muffled snarling]

01:02:12.478 --> 01:02:14.772
SU-HYEOK, WE'RE IN THE
BROADCASTING ROOM, NAM-RA

01:02:14.856 --> 01:02:17.859
[screeching]

01:02:30.329 --> 01:02:31.205
[clinks]

01:02:31.289 --> 01:02:34.292
[snarling]

01:02:34.375 --> 01:02:37.253
-[tense music]
-[shatters]

01:02:38.796 --> 01:02:40.882
[snarling continues]

01:02:43.634 --> 01:02:45.803
[whimpering]

01:02:48.014 --> 01:02:49.223
Oh…

01:02:49.307 --> 01:02:51.309
[suspenseful music]

01:02:54.270 --> 01:02:57.482
[growling]

01:02:59.567 --> 01:03:00.568
[sighs]

01:03:02.737 --> 01:03:04.864
[suspenseful music continues]

01:03:05.782 --> 01:03:07.617
[grunts]

01:03:08.659 --> 01:03:10.453
[snarls]

01:03:16.626 --> 01:03:17.794
Hurry.

01:03:17.877 --> 01:03:18.711
Hurry up.

01:03:18.795 --> 01:03:20.213
Grab her. Okay.

01:03:22.548 --> 01:03:23.966
Careful. Okay. Okay.

01:03:25.051 --> 01:03:27.053
[tense music]

01:03:31.599 --> 01:03:33.935
[growling]

01:03:42.693 --> 01:03:43.653
[snarls]

01:04:02.004 --> 01:04:04.006
[closing theme music]

01:07:48.022 --> 01:07:52.109
ALL CHARACTERS, LOCATIONS, ORGANIZATIONS,
AND EVENTS IN THIS SHOW ARE FICTIONAL.
